# Keep line endings stable across platforms.
#
# The repository is developed on Windows but has to build and run on Linux and
# macOS as well, so everything is stored with LF endings. Windows batch files
# keep CRLF, because cmd.exe needs it.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary files that may end up in the repository.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.appkg binary
